  "summary": "Malicious code in devplatform-spa-plugin-error-boundary (npm)",
  "details": "On require, the package loads a bundled module that downloads a platform-specific binary over HTTPS from oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, and oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev (paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, /pkg/package.exe), with a DNS-TXT fallback that reassembles a base64 payload from TXT records under c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded binary is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe under the Windows temp dir) and executed detached via cmd.exe /c start /b or /bin/sh -c \"... \u0026\".",
